# Bicep build output. The compiled ARM template is a generated artifact that CI
# uploads as evidence; committing it would create a second copy of the source of
# truth that can drift from the .bicep it came from.
infra/**/*.json
!infra/bicepconfig.json
# Terraform plan fixture. Deliberate exception for the same reason as
# bicepconfig.json: this is not a plan artefact of a live deployment but a
# captured, placeholder-only V1 plan that CI replays through
# infra/terraform/tests/check_plan_invariants.py. CI never authenticates to
# Azure, so without a committed fixture the "plan-JSON controls bite" gate could
# not run there at all — and an unchecked control is an unchecked claim.
!infra/terraform/tests/fixtures/plan.v1.json

